<div class="wrap prose">
  <h1>Refund policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: {{ meta.lastUpdatedLegal }}</p>
  <p>If {{ brand.proName }} isn't right for you, you can have your money back in full within <strong>{{ brand.refundDays }} days</strong> of purchase. No questions asked.</p>
  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Email <a href="mailto:{{ brand.supportEmail }}">{{ brand.supportEmail }}</a> from the address you used at checkout, or include that address and your order number.</li>
    <li>We process refunds through Lemon Squeezy within two business days. The money goes back to your original payment method; your bank may take a few more days to show it.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>What happens to your licence</h2>
  <p>After a refund, the licence key stops working and the extension returns to the free features. Nothing you saved is deleted.</p>
  <h2>After {{ brand.refundDays }} days</h2>
  <p>Contact us anyway if something is wrong — and your rights under consumer law, such as the Australian Consumer Law and the 14-day withdrawal right in the EU and UK, always apply.</p>
</div>
